WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
New term dropped. Graph engineering.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
Prompt, context, harness, loop. Again?

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Relax, just reason about it.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.667
Deploy more agents. The terms will not stop.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.333
I cannot out-reason this pace.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.000
Meow. I am a lap behind.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Names change, our stack already has them all.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
So there is no need to run.

